  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.86 - AM020 side-effect-safe computed-receiver fixes\n- Capture semantically proven computed IMapperConfigurationExpression receivers exactly once before replaying the original map and appending missing nested registrations\n- Support property, method-call, indexer, parenthesized, conditional, and ReverseMap receiver shapes in direct constructor and void-method statements\n- Preserve stable receiver output and withhold fixes where direct statement ownership or receiver safety cannot be proven",
